WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.539 --> 01:46.830
=Episode 11=

01:47.600 --> 01:49.390
The spiritual vein
has been unstable in recent years.

01:49.390 --> 01:52.590
Something bad may occur and involve you.

01:53.200 --> 01:56.430
Mr. Yue and Miss Yue,
no matter what happens in the future,

01:56.430 --> 01:59.590
I hope you remain cautious
and brave and never give up.

02:01.910 --> 02:02.910
Never give up?

02:04.910 --> 02:07.040
What do you mean?

02:07.990 --> 02:12.640
You just mentioned the hole of spring
Pureness could tell the future.

02:14.150 --> 02:15.200
Do you know something?

02:16.190 --> 02:18.710
Will we have a disaster in the future?

02:20.800 --> 02:25.000
And you just said

02:25.000 --> 02:26.800
two of us would die soon.

02:27.430 --> 02:28.750
You're just lying, right?

02:29.640 --> 02:31.800
This is what the Cold Marrow indicates.

02:34.640 --> 02:37.120
T-Then who are they?

02:37.710 --> 02:39.230
The ones fated to die, of course.

02:40.120 --> 02:41.480
Lady.

02:49.150 --> 02:51.640
In my view, decades are but a moment.

02:52.590 --> 02:54.700
The hole of spring Garrison
has existed for millions of years.

02:56.040 --> 02:59.079
She could be talking about years away.

03:00.440 --> 03:03.080
That's right.

03:03.720 --> 03:05.320
Alright, let's go back.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.030
Let's go.

03:30.360 --> 03:32.230
Shifang, you seem unhappy.

03:35.870 --> 03:39.320
I'm truly worried about
the words of Wangchen Siming.

03:40.150 --> 03:43.360
She is a Siming,
holding human destiny in her grip.

03:46.720 --> 03:47.960
Don't overthink it.

03:47.960 --> 03:50.550
The two people she mentioned
could be me and Jinzhao.

03:50.550 --> 03:51.750
What nonsense?

03:52.750 --> 03:56.110
Shifang, if one's life
is truly predestined

03:56.110 --> 03:59.600
and cannot be changed,

03:59.600 --> 04:01.800
how absurd and boring that would be?

04:02.880 --> 04:04.280
I'd rather believe

04:04.280 --> 04:07.190
that there's simply no such thing
as fate in this world.

04:08.520 --> 04:09.520
Unchangeable.

04:11.750 --> 04:13.240
That is not the fate I understand.

04:14.640 --> 04:15.660
Mr. Gu.

04:16.829 --> 04:19.750
Look, what do you think
the fate of this tree is?

04:20.440 --> 04:22.520
It may be dying soon, right?

04:23.030 --> 04:25.310
What if I move it to a place
with plentiful water and fertile land

04:25.310 --> 04:26.910
and regularly prune it?

04:27.800 --> 04:29.830
Then perhaps being saved
by you is its fate.

04:29.830 --> 04:32.550
What if I change my mind
after hearing your words?

04:35.110 --> 04:38.360
In my view, the future
holds countless possibilities,

04:38.360 --> 04:42.310
and among them, there is one that seems
to be most likely to come true.

04:42.880 --> 04:45.800
People call it "fate".

04:47.390 --> 04:50.640
But if someone with enough conviction
and strength to defy the path of heaven,

04:50.640 --> 04:54.280
it's not impossible
to take another path.

04:56.190 --> 04:57.720
Simply put, it's like this tree.

04:58.550 --> 05:01.880
If left to its own, it would surely die.

05:01.880 --> 05:04.670
But if someone saves it
and it fights for its own survival,

05:05.280 --> 05:06.730
there may be a way out.

05:08.950 --> 05:13.800
Even the slightest change
will alter Pureness's prophecy.

05:14.880 --> 05:16.360
Is that so, Mr. Gu?

05:18.080 --> 05:19.640
You're so clever.

05:22.280 --> 05:24.780
It's good there's still hope.

05:25.310 --> 05:26.880
Shifang, let's go back then.

05:28.670 --> 05:29.680
Okay.

05:41.159 --> 05:43.390
Everyone has left,
and you're still here.

05:43.390 --> 05:44.830
Is there something you can't figure out?

05:45.440 --> 05:46.510
Mr. Gu.

05:49.640 --> 05:50.800
Don't force things.

05:51.390 --> 05:54.000
When the time comes,
answers will come out.

05:55.390 --> 05:57.030
Yes, you're right.

05:58.390 --> 06:02.160
You and Miss Yue
are not biological siblings, are you?

06:03.390 --> 06:04.670
No.

06:04.670 --> 06:08.230
Xian Qing told me you and Miss Yue
were practicing a spell called...

06:10.670 --> 06:12.600
Omnipotent

06:12.600 --> 06:13.920
Mindlink.

06:15.040 --> 06:17.670
Omnipotent. How interesting.

06:17.670 --> 06:19.950
May I ask where you learned this skill?

06:21.600 --> 06:25.200
Qi and I knew it as soon as we woke up
in the Wuyan Village.

06:26.160 --> 06:27.280
It really is magical.

06:28.390 --> 06:31.160
Since the spell exists with you two,

06:31.160 --> 06:33.880
it seems the secret
may lie in the feelings.

06:33.880 --> 06:36.320
The longer the two of you are together
and the deeper the feelings,

06:36.320 --> 06:38.670
the more powerful the spell becomes.

06:42.230 --> 06:44.950
The deeper the feelings,
the stronger the power.

06:48.950 --> 06:52.670
By the way, may I ask something?

06:52.670 --> 06:53.800
Okay, please.

06:55.000 --> 06:58.600
Why did you tell Qi to think for herself

06:59.480 --> 07:00.920
and stop always listening to others?

07:02.110 --> 07:03.510
Isn't this the way it should be?

07:06.000 --> 07:08.230
Qi is naive, kind and easily deceived.

07:08.790 --> 07:10.830
We have depended on each other
for these three years.

07:10.830 --> 07:11.950
I'm not some random person.

07:13.000 --> 07:16.390
Besides, didn't you say
the deeper our bond,

07:16.390 --> 07:18.600
the stronger Mindlink would be?

07:20.320 --> 07:23.000
Miss Yue's being independent

07:23.000 --> 07:25.040
doesn't conflict
with your bond's deepening.

07:26.070 --> 07:27.600
From what I've seen these past few days,

07:27.600 --> 07:29.600
Miss Yue is innocent,
but she's not foolish.

07:30.510 --> 07:32.000
One day she'll understand

07:32.630 --> 07:35.830
that her world does not only
consist of the two of you.

07:35.830 --> 07:38.110
Overprotection, in the end, is improper.

07:38.630 --> 07:41.159
No, she can't live without me.

07:44.320 --> 07:46.480
Is it really that Miss Yue
can't live without you

07:46.480 --> 07:48.110
or you can't live without Miss Yue?

07:53.070 --> 07:54.159
As you have seen,

07:54.920 --> 07:57.790
Qi and I are destined
to be together forever.

07:58.600 --> 08:01.630
Does the question matter?

08:04.390 --> 08:05.510
I'll take my leave.

08:21.950 --> 08:23.050
Jinzhao,

08:33.110 --> 08:35.200
still thinking about
what Wangchen Siming said?

08:35.760 --> 08:38.549
Didn't Mr. Gu say fate could be changed?

08:41.630 --> 08:45.320
Qi, we came into this world together.

08:46.200 --> 08:49.480
Have you ever thought about
what exactly our relationship is?

08:54.390 --> 08:56.160
Regardless of what our relationship is,

08:56.160 --> 08:58.160
we will always be together anyway.

08:58.160 --> 08:59.830
What difference does it make
to know or not?

09:03.200 --> 09:07.200
But this world is much bigger
than we imagine.

09:08.040 --> 09:12.230
Are you sure
we can really be together forever?

09:12.230 --> 09:15.000
Certainly. I'll take you
with me wherever I go,

09:15.000 --> 09:16.510
because I'm going to protect you.

09:20.760 --> 09:25.230
(Never mind. I've already decided
to be your lifelong support.)

09:26.110 --> 09:27.510
(Forget about defining
our relationship.)

09:32.600 --> 09:33.680
Follow me.

09:34.830 --> 09:35.920
Let's go.

09:52.350 --> 09:56.790
Qi, Mr. Gu said the deeper our bond,

09:57.670 --> 10:01.110
the more powerful Mindlink would be.

10:03.440 --> 10:06.390
Shall we try to deepen our bond further?

10:08.070 --> 10:09.130
How do we try?

10:10.230 --> 10:13.920
The ancients said the night

10:13.920 --> 10:16.430
was the best time
to deepen the relationship.

10:18.990 --> 10:20.990
Just through watching the moon?

10:22.310 --> 10:24.600
Of course not.
There should be poems as well.

10:25.750 --> 10:26.830
What poems?

10:30.870 --> 10:32.010
Let me give it a try.

10:35.480 --> 10:41.040
Listen. Night after night, I yearn
for you. Even the moon seems dimmed.

10:43.390 --> 10:44.460
What do you think?

10:47.500 --> 10:48.560
How's it?

10:48.560 --> 10:49.610
What does it mean?

10:55.310 --> 10:56.460
Jinzhao, look.

11:06.430 --> 11:07.750
They are called Tideng.

11:08.510 --> 11:10.160
Mr. Gu said every year in spring,

11:10.680 --> 11:13.280
they would migrate from the clouds.

11:13.280 --> 11:17.830
They may temporarily
bring back lost spells.

11:18.720 --> 11:20.360
Lost spells?

11:23.630 --> 11:26.480
Can we catch one and carry it with us?

11:27.190 --> 11:29.160
They are spirits. You can't catch them.

11:38.870 --> 11:39.920
What are you doing?

11:41.310 --> 11:43.480
Haven't you always wanted
to try sword flying?

11:43.480 --> 11:44.510
Let's give it a try.

11:44.510 --> 11:46.160
Is your Thought Sword okay?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.600
Just give it a try.

11:59.310 --> 12:02.480
♪Looking back♪

12:02.480 --> 12:06.060
♪I try to bring back memories♪

12:06.060 --> 12:10.860
♪We're connected♪

12:10.860 --> 12:13.160
♪It's meant to be♪

12:14.860 --> 12:17.840
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

12:18.740 --> 12:22.060
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

12:22.700 --> 12:24.940
♪On a moonlight night♪

12:24.940 --> 12:26.760
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

12:26.760 --> 12:29.480
♪About you♪

12:29.480 --> 12:33.390
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

12:33.390 --> 12:37.230
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

12:37.230 --> 12:39.280
♪The past glided before my mind♪

12:39.280 --> 12:41.610
♪I smiled and cried♪

12:41.610 --> 12:46.730
♪For happiness♪

12:46.730 --> 12:50.890
♪I've been looking for you♪

12:50.890 --> 12:55.180
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

12:55.180 --> 12:57.260
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

12:57.260 --> 12:59.210
♪I engrave your name♪

12:59.210 --> 13:06.120
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

13:16.240 --> 13:18.950
Jinzhao, have we bonded by doing this?

13:20.870 --> 13:23.360
Perhaps, maybe, I suppose.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.760
Then let's try again.

13:29.800 --> 13:30.800
How do we try?

13:32.310 --> 13:33.510
You close your eyes first.

13:43.120 --> 13:44.170
Yue Qi.

13:45.870 --> 13:47.990
This is how you try?

13:48.950 --> 13:50.360
Then you do it.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.650
Come on.

13:59.510 --> 14:00.590
Look, Jinzhao.

14:02.390 --> 14:03.470
What?

14:27.600 --> 14:31.160
Jinzhao, y-y-your lips are so soft.

14:32.360 --> 14:34.600
Qi, do you have any idea...?

14:36.160 --> 14:38.630
Forget it, it's late. Let's go back.

14:43.600 --> 14:44.650
You're blushing.

14:45.160 --> 14:46.560
You saw it wrong.

14:46.560 --> 14:49.720
It's true. You're blushing.
I didn't see it wrong.

14:51.190 --> 14:52.200
Let me look.

15:03.190 --> 15:04.560
It seems that Xian Qing and Xiu

15:05.920 --> 15:08.920
will have profound entanglements
with Mr. Yue and Miss Yue in the future.

15:18.720 --> 15:21.560
Seeing the light on in the study,
I knew you were still working.

15:24.510 --> 15:25.800
Do you have something to tell me?

15:29.630 --> 15:30.870
Today in the illusion,

15:31.600 --> 15:34.040
I saw you cut down
the hibiscus tree in the yard.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.950
The first year I came to Mount Yuqing,

15:41.870 --> 15:43.950
you planted that hibiscus tree for me.

15:45.560 --> 15:49.480
But three years ago, I followed you
to the Spring Vein for the first time,

15:49.480 --> 15:53.280
and after we came back,
you cut down the hibiscus tree

15:54.510 --> 15:55.600
and planted a pear tree instead.

15:57.070 --> 16:01.280
You also weren't as close
to me as before.

16:01.990 --> 16:05.360
To this day,
you still haven't told me the reason.

16:07.920 --> 16:11.830
And you keep trying to urge me
to take over as Pureness's guardian.

16:12.950 --> 16:15.750
But who would want to inherit
a place that brought them heartache?

16:19.750 --> 16:24.430
I told you I cut down the tree
to prevent you from being distracted

16:24.430 --> 16:25.930
so that you could focus on
your cultivation.

16:27.390 --> 16:30.600
You've grown up and should start
your own adventure and make friends

16:30.600 --> 16:31.870
to complete your training sooner.

16:32.800 --> 16:37.280
I can't take care of you forever.

16:42.830 --> 16:45.920
It's late at night.
Go back and rest early.

16:47.750 --> 16:49.510
Then let me take care of you forever.

16:51.150 --> 16:56.010
♪Why do I see tears
shimmering in your eyes♪

16:56.010 --> 17:01.520
♪What I thought would be evergreen
withers between my fingers♪

17:01.520 --> 17:07.020
♪Even our hug feels unnatural♪

17:07.690 --> 17:12.200
♪If it's all fate♪

17:14.950 --> 17:16.480
Let go of those thoughts.

17:19.560 --> 17:20.619
It's impossible.

17:24.430 --> 17:25.950
I'm a stubborn person,

17:27.480 --> 17:31.280
and you've never beaten me
at being stubborn.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.920
You could cut down the hibiscus tree
in this courtyard,

17:38.160 --> 17:39.510
but you can never cut down

17:41.630 --> 17:42.950
the one in my heart.

18:12.750 --> 18:13.870
Why am I so hot?

18:35.870 --> 18:36.910
This isn't right.

18:45.390 --> 18:46.410
Nor is this.

18:56.440 --> 18:59.040
Why can't I find that feeling
from just now anymore?

19:07.280 --> 19:09.230
(So this is the feeling.)

19:48.720 --> 19:50.670
(Zhengwu Alliance)

19:55.390 --> 19:59.160
Could it be the Zhengwu Alliance?

20:16.040 --> 20:17.080
Shifang.

20:17.080 --> 20:18.220
Jinzhao.

20:22.630 --> 20:27.110
Shifang, I've never heard you mention
anything about the Zhengwu Alliance.

20:30.510 --> 20:32.040
Why are you suddenly asking this?

20:33.040 --> 20:34.510
Isn't my injury healed?

20:34.510 --> 20:36.800
According to our previous agreement,
it's time to go to Luo.

20:36.800 --> 20:38.230
Doesn't it mean
I'm going to your alliance?

20:39.560 --> 20:41.510
Tell me a bit so I have an idea.

20:42.200 --> 20:47.440
For example, what does your leader
look like? Is he strict with people?

20:50.230 --> 20:57.200
Alright. Our leader wears black clothes
all year round and has a beard.

20:57.200 --> 21:00.840
He gives off a feeling
of both boldness and authority.

21:01.630 --> 21:02.750
Everyone respects him greatly.

21:04.990 --> 21:08.080
(So the person I saw last night
must have been Zuo Guanren.)

21:10.680 --> 21:13.320
When do you plan to leave, Jinzhao?

21:13.960 --> 21:15.040
No time like the present.

21:16.040 --> 21:18.920
I'll inform Mr. Gu
and we will set off tomorrow.

21:22.710 --> 21:25.510
(Now there's no reason to keep
dragging my feet and not go back.)

21:49.350 --> 21:52.750
Xiu, how much longer
are you going to dawdle?

21:53.590 --> 21:56.200
Yue and the others
are waiting for you to set off together.

22:00.160 --> 22:03.280
Master, let me stay with you
for a few more days.

22:03.840 --> 22:06.710
It's good to go down the mountain
and experience life when you're young.

22:09.630 --> 22:11.710
There's not much good in it.

22:11.710 --> 22:14.080
Master, the spells you taught me
come from the Taoist school.

22:14.800 --> 22:16.750
Taoists value serenity and natural action.

22:17.840 --> 22:20.840
Isn't our seclusion here
in line with their principles?

22:20.840 --> 22:22.000
Why should I go down the mountain?

22:23.200 --> 22:25.320
How can one speak of transcendence
without experiencing life?

22:26.440 --> 22:29.750
Only after trials can you understand
the path you truly want to take.

22:30.800 --> 22:33.630
But don't I often go down the mountain
to exorcise demons?

22:33.630 --> 22:34.890
And I've joined the Zhengwu Alliance.

22:42.040 --> 22:45.470
You were an obedient
and cute little girl.

22:46.350 --> 22:48.280
Now you've become
so solitary and oblique.

22:48.990 --> 22:50.230
It's all my fault.

22:51.110 --> 22:53.510
I knew full well
that I didn't know how to raise a child

22:53.510 --> 22:55.960
and that Xian Qing could only
teach you things about demons,

22:57.040 --> 23:00.800
but I never had the heart
to have you adopted by a normal family.

23:00.800 --> 23:02.080
I really shouldn't have.

23:02.870 --> 23:04.010
So it's on me?

23:06.630 --> 23:10.390
No, it's all my fault.

23:11.800 --> 23:14.680
Master, no need to say more. I'll go.

23:22.080 --> 23:25.040
Your master's acting is bad.

23:28.390 --> 23:32.200
A gentleman does not speak ill
of others behind their backs.

23:32.750 --> 23:35.350
That's why I haven't tried
to hide it, have I?

23:36.630 --> 23:39.280
Why don't you accompany Xiu
on her trip as a light punishment?

23:40.870 --> 23:41.930
I knew it.

23:43.080 --> 23:45.080
It just so happens
that you want to go to Jing'an, right?

23:48.110 --> 23:51.200
You should set off before it's late.

23:54.200 --> 23:57.350
Master, I don't want
that answer anymore.

23:59.110 --> 24:00.800
Could you let me stay to accompany you?

24:05.710 --> 24:09.390
Xiu, take good care of yourself
when you're away from home.

24:09.390 --> 24:11.750
And try to care more about others.

24:14.960 --> 24:16.280
I just need you.

24:26.680 --> 24:28.390
Xiu wants to stay by your side.

24:29.110 --> 24:31.160
Why are you pushing her away?

24:32.800 --> 24:36.280
She's already 18.
She should have a better future.

24:41.280 --> 24:44.440
The stubbornness of humans.

24:46.080 --> 24:50.110
Xian Qing, please
take good care of Xiu for me.

24:52.630 --> 24:54.630
No need to say more. I'll go.

25:10.160 --> 25:11.210
Take care.

25:21.420 --> 25:24.550
(Jing'an)

25:32.080 --> 25:37.110
Last time, I mentioned
the beginning of the world.

25:41.200 --> 25:43.510
Five steamers of Xiaolongbao. Enjoy.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.320
Shifang, the baozi are here.

25:50.390 --> 25:51.560
Come on, let's eat baozi.

25:51.560 --> 25:56.160
To know what happens next,
come here next time.

25:59.800 --> 26:03.080
Shifang, are you still
thinking about that prophecy?

26:03.080 --> 26:06.320
Mr. Gu said it might change.
Don't worry too much.

26:07.990 --> 26:10.990
I'm not thinking about that.
I'm thinking...

26:10.990 --> 26:13.160
Is it the Bian Luohuan affair
that you're worried about?

26:16.920 --> 26:20.320
I was going to capture a didact
of the Qiyuan Sect to prove myself,

26:21.390 --> 26:23.350
but that person ran away.

26:24.510 --> 26:26.040
Did we destroy the Fujin Hall?

26:28.630 --> 26:29.680
Yes.

26:29.680 --> 26:30.700
I'll count it on you.

26:33.480 --> 26:34.510
Really?

26:34.510 --> 26:36.960
And also everything
at the Luori Village is on you.

26:39.630 --> 26:40.960
Jinzhao, I toast to you.

26:42.110 --> 26:45.680
Xiu and I were at the Luori Village too.
How come you don't toast to us?

26:46.350 --> 26:48.110
Yes, a toast to all.

26:49.710 --> 26:51.510
Let me toast with soup.

26:53.290 --> 26:54.350
Don't mention it.

26:54.350 --> 26:56.630
I hear there's trouble
at the entrance of the Zhengwu Alliance.

26:56.630 --> 26:57.960
It seems to be the Qiyuan Sect.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.200
- Let's go take a look.
- Let's go.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.620
I'll go back to the alliance to check.

27:01.320 --> 27:03.340
Shifang, let's go together.

27:03.340 --> 27:04.430
Let's go.

27:06.280 --> 27:08.750
Please wrap these up.
We'll come back to pick them up later.

27:22.920 --> 27:25.770
(Zhengwu Alliance, the top martial faction)
Step back. Did you hear that?

27:25.770 --> 27:27.870
All of you move back.

27:27.870 --> 27:29.510
You all, move back.

27:30.920 --> 27:33.040
If anyone takes one more step forward,
I'll kill my daughter.

27:36.230 --> 27:39.590
Aren't they Lv Dazhi
and his daughter Lv Fei'er?

27:39.590 --> 27:40.650
You know them?

27:40.650 --> 27:43.320
He's my neighbor.
He joined the Qiyuan Sect last year.

27:43.320 --> 27:46.760
He donated all his family property
and caused his wife's death in anger.

27:47.280 --> 27:50.280
You lackeys should have died long ago.

27:50.920 --> 27:54.800
Where's Zuo Guanren? Call him out!

28:25.870 --> 28:26.960
I can't see either.

28:26.960 --> 28:29.350
Get down. What are you looking at?

28:35.990 --> 28:37.040
What are you looking at?

28:39.960 --> 28:41.390
Stop deceiving the common people.

28:42.590 --> 28:44.960
Call Zuo Guanren out!

28:46.680 --> 28:48.960
My lord, how far
has the drama progressed?

28:52.590 --> 28:53.840
Zuo Guanren, if you don't come out,

28:53.840 --> 28:56.230
I'll kill my daughter!

28:56.230 --> 28:58.350
How is Lv Dazhi's performance?

28:58.350 --> 28:59.440
Not bad.

29:00.630 --> 29:01.710
I got him.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.350
Zuo Guanren!

29:07.380 --> 29:08.720
(Zhengwu Alliance)

29:11.320 --> 29:13.390
It's Leader Zuo.
Leader Zuo has come out.

29:13.390 --> 29:14.480
Leader Zuo has come out.

29:14.480 --> 29:15.600
It's Leader Zuo.

29:15.600 --> 29:17.110
This is Leader Zuo.

29:17.110 --> 29:18.630
Why are those crazy ones here?

29:18.630 --> 29:19.800
- What?
- Don't move.

29:30.380 --> 29:31.470
Don't move.

29:31.470 --> 29:33.110
My lord, I need to verify something.

29:34.800 --> 29:35.990
Laying hands on a child?

29:35.990 --> 29:37.070
Yeah.

29:40.160 --> 29:42.190
(Zuo Guanren, Zhengwu Alliance Leader)
I am Zuo Guanren.

29:42.680 --> 29:47.040
Zuo Guanren, you finally show up.

29:47.040 --> 29:49.560
Everyone take a good look.
This is Zuo Guanren.

29:49.560 --> 29:52.960
He slaughtered our sect leader
and persecuted our buddies.

29:52.960 --> 29:55.320
He obstructs the great rise of our sect.

29:55.320 --> 29:56.590
You have done all the evil you could.

29:56.590 --> 29:57.680
Stop talking nonsense.

29:58.350 --> 29:59.880
The Qiyuan Sect has committed
numerous evils.

30:00.680 --> 30:04.160
They bewitch people and destroy
families, provoking great wrath.

30:05.470 --> 30:09.550
If we turn a blind eye,
wouldn't that dishearten the people?

30:09.550 --> 30:10.600
- Right.
- Yes.

30:10.600 --> 30:11.790
- Well said.
- Yeah.

30:15.020 --> 30:15.950
Shut up.

30:16.840 --> 30:20.510
Zuo Guanren, you're talking nonsense.
Today I'm going to tell you.

30:20.510 --> 30:23.350
From now on, you're not allowed
to sabotage our sect. Do you hear me?

30:23.990 --> 30:25.840
We never let go of evildoers.

30:26.870 --> 30:30.590
If you have a shred of humanity left,
let go of your daughter.

30:30.590 --> 30:33.390
Just agree to him first
to save that young girl.

30:33.390 --> 30:35.750
No, that will only
encourage the Qiyuan Sect

30:35.750 --> 30:37.320
to capture more people to threaten them.

30:38.470 --> 30:39.560
We must save the person.

30:41.470 --> 30:42.630
Doing this sort of thing.

30:42.630 --> 30:44.350
Is there such a father?

30:44.350 --> 30:45.420
Really.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.040
Don't you feel pity?

30:48.040 --> 30:49.680
How will this child face things
when she grows up?

30:49.680 --> 30:51.350
Wen Yang, quick!

30:51.350 --> 30:52.360
Yes.

30:53.320 --> 30:56.630
Don't move. Don't come. Do you hear me?

30:59.200 --> 31:02.560
To eliminate dissenters,
you even don't care about a life.

31:02.560 --> 31:04.040
You forced me into this.

31:04.560 --> 31:07.470
Today, I will ascend with my daughter,
using blood as our libation.

31:07.470 --> 31:10.040
Wait. Wait.

31:11.560 --> 31:13.110
Maybe Jinzhao has some way.

31:14.320 --> 31:15.390
Jinzhao has a brilliant plan.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.040
Wait.

31:17.040 --> 31:18.350
Stop right there.

31:18.350 --> 31:20.590
Bro, I'm friendly.

31:20.590 --> 31:23.870
To be honest, I've been displeased
with the Zhengwu Alliance for so long.

31:24.630 --> 31:26.510
Under the guise of eliminating the sect,

31:26.510 --> 31:27.920
they're seeking fame and fortune.

31:28.840 --> 31:34.920
How dare you offend Lord Ming?
You're unforgivable. You are dead.

31:35.710 --> 31:36.710
Yeah.

31:36.710 --> 31:40.840
Bro, congratulations
on your successful ascension, but...

31:41.560 --> 31:42.600
But what?

31:44.710 --> 31:48.350
But people die
every moment in the world.

31:48.350 --> 31:53.350
How will Lord Ming know you die
for the great cause of the sect?

31:54.320 --> 31:56.470
Any loyal disciple

31:57.320 --> 31:59.470
receives Lord Ming's token.

32:09.350 --> 32:10.630
What did he take out?

32:10.630 --> 32:12.590
- Flying.
- It's flying.

32:13.230 --> 32:16.750
It's Lord Ming.
Lord Ming is summoning me.

32:21.230 --> 32:22.680
(I must not let the orb harm Qi.)

32:25.040 --> 32:26.080
I got the token.

32:27.680 --> 32:30.800
I got the token. I have the token.

32:30.800 --> 32:33.200
I got the token.

32:33.200 --> 32:35.320
I'm going to ascend.

32:35.320 --> 32:36.800
I'm going to ascend to serve Lord Ming.

32:36.800 --> 32:38.510
I'm going to ascend.

32:39.390 --> 32:42.320
I'm going to ascend.

32:43.710 --> 32:44.800
This child must be delirious.

32:55.470 --> 32:57.680
The Zhengwu Alliance
really lives up to its reputation.

32:57.680 --> 33:00.280
Yeah, look,
the one using a hidden weapon

33:00.280 --> 33:02.280
(Wen Yang, Yongwu Hall Head)
is Wen Yang, Yongwu Hall Head.

33:03.320 --> 33:05.680
(Qiu Lingyun, Cloud Hall Head)
And that lady is Qiu Lingyun.

33:05.680 --> 33:08.750
She's the head of the Cloud Hall.
She can move very swiftly and lightly.

33:08.750 --> 33:13.590
It's really a place full of talent.
You're a head, so you are powerful too.

33:17.870 --> 33:20.200
Director Gao,

33:21.990 --> 33:23.390
I'm sorry.

33:23.390 --> 33:25.320
I'm sorry.

33:26.990 --> 33:29.320
My apologies. I was just too astonished.

33:29.320 --> 33:32.560
I was stupid.
I shouldn't have trusted you.

33:32.560 --> 33:34.560
Quick, pooh.

33:34.560 --> 33:35.750
How can you call yourself stupid?

33:36.870 --> 33:39.960
You are the next one
of our sect who will ascend.

33:39.960 --> 33:42.630
How can you say that? Wasn't I just...?

33:42.630 --> 33:47.080
Didn't you say that Lv
had very good eloquence?

33:47.080 --> 33:51.080
Didn't you say he could tarnish
the reputation of the Zhengwu Alliance?

33:51.080 --> 33:53.840
How would I know
there would be six buzzkills?

33:57.560 --> 34:01.510
But then again,
those people are always around.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.870
Who can say otherwise?

34:03.870 --> 34:05.800
Thankfully you're our leader.

34:05.800 --> 34:08.560
Every time, you manage to lead
a strategic retreat successfully.

34:09.590 --> 34:13.630
These people really
are like gum on a shoe.

34:13.630 --> 34:14.920
You can't shake them off at all.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.120
Do you understand what I mean?

34:19.510 --> 34:22.800
Do you mean to say we are shoes?

34:24.110 --> 34:27.679
You're a shoe.

34:28.560 --> 34:29.750
Yes.

34:29.750 --> 34:31.080
What I mean to say is

34:31.800 --> 34:33.590
we can't do anything about those guys.

34:34.630 --> 34:36.870
Then let the Zhengwu Alliance
deal with them.

34:37.679 --> 34:39.469
Wouldn't it be easier
if you just said it directly?

34:41.960 --> 34:42.960
Continue.

34:48.969 --> 34:50.080
This time, stay down for me.

34:50.080 --> 34:51.210
Alright.

34:52.630 --> 34:54.590
If you move again, I'll beat you up.

35:00.080 --> 35:01.160
Amazing.

35:01.160 --> 35:02.280
- Good.
- Good.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.280
Are you okay?

35:10.320 --> 35:11.600
Are you okay?

35:22.040 --> 35:23.110
You're fit to be a father?

35:29.560 --> 35:30.570
Leader.

35:34.590 --> 35:38.440
The Qiyuan Sect
can even manage to bewitch people

35:39.680 --> 35:43.200
to commit such unconscionable acts.

35:43.960 --> 35:45.990
It fully shows their evil nature.

35:47.390 --> 35:53.470
I've long sworn to lead the removal
of the sect for the peace of the people.

35:53.470 --> 35:54.950
- Good.
- Good.

35:54.950 --> 36:02.710
- Wipe out the Qiyuan Sect.
- Wipe out the Qiyuan Sect.

36:02.710 --> 36:05.360
We need to deal with the aftermath.

36:05.360 --> 36:07.510
Please, everyone, disperse.

36:15.670 --> 36:18.480
Lingyun, take good care
of this little girl.

36:18.480 --> 36:19.560
Yes.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.650
- Wen Yang.
- Yes.

36:20.650 --> 36:23.400
Lock the person up
and immediately investigate his home.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.430
Yes.

36:24.430 --> 36:26.320
- Take him away.
- Get up. Go.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.950
Thank you all for your assistance.

36:28.950 --> 36:31.080
Come with me to the hall to talk.

36:33.430 --> 36:34.480
Let's all go inside as well.

36:37.750 --> 36:42.350
It's okay, girl.

36:45.990 --> 36:49.040
Ming Xiu is so gentle.
She seems different.

36:49.670 --> 36:51.430
Xiu must have thought of her childhood.

36:52.400 --> 36:55.150
Childhood? What is that?

36:55.150 --> 36:57.120
There's no need to talk about the past.

36:57.800 --> 37:02.470
Fei'er, be good. You will go
with that lady in a while.

37:27.050 --> 37:29.250
Little girl, stop crying.

37:29.520 --> 37:31.120
I've killed the demon.

37:31.120 --> 37:32.750
But my mother...

37:52.800 --> 37:56.560
Mother!

37:57.910 --> 38:02.430
Mother!

38:48.690 --> 38:52.210
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

38:53.710 --> 38:57.000
♪Burns what once was♪

38:57.780 --> 39:00.620
♪The name is forgotten♪

39:04.720 --> 39:08.520
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

39:09.740 --> 39:12.650
♪Only through the eyes♪

39:13.490 --> 39:17.040
♪Who can see them clearly♪

39:18.670 --> 39:25.320
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:26.540 --> 39:33.390
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:34.730 --> 39:42.670
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

39:42.670 --> 39:49.640
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

40:06.670 --> 40:10.670
♪The seemingly random paths♪

40:11.730 --> 40:15.210
♪The burning traces♪

40:15.730 --> 40:20.010
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

40:22.610 --> 40:27.050
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

40:27.760 --> 40:31.080
♪Are all carefully♪

40:31.700 --> 40:35.760
♪Arranged by me♪

40:36.720 --> 40:44.080
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

40:44.650 --> 40:51.660
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

40:51.660 --> 41:00.650
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

41:00.650 --> 41:07.920
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

41:08.680 --> 41:16.110
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

41:16.680 --> 41:24.080
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

41:24.750 --> 41:32.270
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

41:32.810 --> 41:42.350
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
